{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Input｜流程图\n按键到能力申请的时间顺序。类与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_输入与意图.canvas|结构图]]、[[Input/结构|结构文档]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "action",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Enhanced Input 发出 InputAction 轴值或按下/松开。\n\nUE Enhanced Input 触发 InputAction::Started/Completed 或 Triggered 轴值；不直接激活 GA。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 378,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "map",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. InputConfig 与 InputComponent 将 Action 绑定到对应 Tag 回调。\n\nHeroComponent::InitializePlayerInput → InputComponent::BindNativeAction/BindAbilityActions(InputConfig, Callbacks)。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 378,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "branch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. HeroComponent 按输入类型分流。\n\n回调：HeroComponent::Input_Move / Input_LookMouse / Input_LookStick / Input_AbilityInputTagPressed/Released。",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 378,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "move",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "移动/视角轴值：直接交给 CMC / Controller。\n[[Movement/结构]]\n\nInput_Move → Pawn::AddMovementInput；Input_Look* → Pawn::AddControllerYawInput/AddControllerPitchInput；不走 ASC。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 216,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ability",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ability InputTag：Pressed/Released 先写入 ASC 缓存。\n\nInput_AbilityInputTagPressed/Released(Tag) → ASC::AbilityInputTagPressed/Released(Tag)；只写 Handle 集。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 743,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "consume",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. PlayerController::PostProcessInput 调 ASC::ProcessAbilityInput，统一申请激活。\n\nPlayerController::PostProcessInput(dt, paused) → ASC::ProcessAbilityInput → TryActivateAbility(Handle)。",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 945,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "retry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "可重试拒绝：HeroComponent 暂存意图，组释放后再请求。\n[[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas]]\n\nASC::OnAbilityInputRetryable → HeroComponent::BufferAbilityInput；OnAbilityGroupFreed → HandleAbilityGroupFreed 重交 Tag。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 1269,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "action",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "map",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "BindNativeAction / BindAbilityActions"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "map",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "branch",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "HeroComponent 输入回调"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "branch",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "move",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "AddMovementInput / AddControllerYawInput"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "branch",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "ability",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "ASC::AbilityInputTagPressed/Released"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "ability",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "consume",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "PostProcessInput → ProcessAbilityInput"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "consume",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "retry",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "OnAbilityInputRetryable → BufferAbilityInput"
    }
  ]
}
